# The Baptist Standard Bearer, foreword (dated 20 October 1984) to its edition of Gill's Body of Divinity (docs/sources/lee-bsb.md).
# NOT public domain: cited by page only, nothing quoted. No Body, Holding, Argument or gc:quotation here.

<source/bsb-gill-1984> a gc:SourceWork ;
    rdfs:label "The Baptist Standard Bearer, foreword to Gill's Body of Divinity (1984)"@en ;
    dcterms:bibliographicCitation "The Baptist Standard Bearer edition of Gill's Body of Divinity; foreword dated 20 October 1984. Not public domain; cited by page only." .

# Foreword pp. vii-viii, propositions 1 and 7 (ruling B-Q4). Nothing links to it yet; source/plumb-line/validity-3 will link by rdfs:seeAlso when the sitting writes it.
<source/bsb-gill-1984/foreword/vii-viii> a gc:SourceDivision ;
    rdfs:label "BSB foreword, pp. vii-viii, propositions 1 and 7"@en ;
    dcterms:isPartOf <source/bsb-gill-1984> .
